<title>UK: Woolwich B/S sets 400 mln mark FRN.</title>
<headline>Woolwich B/S sets 400 mln mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WOOLWICH BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DEM   SPREAD     6.25 BP   MATURITY    23.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    23.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.955    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.1	 PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
